# Anchor STM32 demo-project ignores to the repo root so they don't
# catch unrelated lowercase 'core' directories deep in microros_include
# (case-insensitive on macOS / Windows filesystems would otherwise
# silently drop uxr/client/core/* headers from the tracked tree).
/Core
/Drivers
/EWARM
/Middlewares
/.mxproject
/Makefile
/build
/.vscode
/custombuild
*.s
*.ld
# NOTE (isc-fs fork): the upstream repo ignores libmicroros/ to keep prebuilt
# artifacts out of source. Our fork ships them so downstream firmware repos
# don't need Docker to rebuild from scratch. Track them explicitly.
!libmicroros